{"id":"rodnoj","lemma":"родной","pos":"adj","rank":1961,"glosses":["native, childhood, home (relating to where one was born or grew up; relating to one's homeland)","biological, own, closely or directly related by blood","dear"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a1/Ru-%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"родное","feminine":"родная","plural":"родные"},"examples":[{"text":"Какой твой родной язык?","en":"What's your native language?","words":[{"g":"what, what one"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"tongue"}]},{"text":"Кто знает о тебе больше, чем родная мать?","en":"Who knows more about you than your own mother?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"any more"},{"g":"than"},null,{"g":"mother"}]},{"text":"Это мой родной город.","en":"This is my hometown.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"city, town"}]},{"text":"Родная мать их бросила.","en":"Their birth mother abandoned them.","words":[null,{"g":"mother"},{"g":"them / their"},{"g":"to throw","l":"бросить"}]},{"text":"Том мне как родной сын.","en":"Tom is like my own son.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"how / like"},null,{"g":"son"}]}]}